/* web: app/App.module.css の .stage（1280×720 を --ui-scale 倍して中央）と .viewportOverlay（実画面いっぱい）。UITK は PanelSettings の Expand が倍率を持つので舞台は固定寸法で中央に置く */
/* web: .stage (1280x720 scaled by --ui-scale, centered) and .viewportOverlay (full real screen) in app/App.module.css; in UITK the PanelSettings Expand owns the scale, so the stage is a fixed size centered */
.game-ui-layer {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
}

.ui-stage-frame__viewport {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
}

.ui-stage-frame__stage {
    width: 1280px;
    height: 720px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}
